<p>RankPro uses your account details, practice data and contact information to run tests, show results and support you on WhatsApp, email or phone.</p>
<p>We do not sell your personal data. Information is shared only with service providers needed to operate the platform, such as payment or messaging tools, and when the law requires it.</p>
<p>You can ask us to update or remove your account details by writing to the support email listed in Website Settings / the footer.</p>
<p>This page may be updated as the product grows. The latest version will always be available here.</p>
